# Files excluded from clang-format (batch I accidentally reformatted these).
#
# _NOT_FOR_INCLUDE_: vendored Apple JavaScriptCore headers kept purely as IDE
# reference; they are never compiled and must stay byte-identical to upstream.
_NOT_FOR_INCLUDE_/

# X-macro definition tables: column alignment is part of the table's
# readability contract; reformatting destroys the row structure.
*.def.h

# Generated files are rewritten by the build; formatting them guarantees a
# permanent diff churn on every scons run.
*.gen.h
*.gen.cpp
